{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"7ef7b8d123861f881f9ff0bf36be3c68db435e5a1c6345bcde9555f9f0c4d3d7","ja":"コラボ商品をプロデュース","zh":"策划联动商品","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7825b6df1cf757f577527dc7957218b8bdfbd2dbc9748950a7db984749129d16","ja":"某日、可憐はとある企画会議に参加していた……","zh":"某天，可怜参加了某场企划会议……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ce380b31485c7e852b7cfe220fccf3ba6a5202646cf2ea80358523d080bbe823","ja":"えっ……！　わ、私がコラボ商品のプロデュース\n……ですか？　で、でも……！","zh":"咦……！由、由我来担任联名商品的制作人\n……吗？但、但是……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"029b1be2c0b70980fce8d5a3ed074a80ee21584f6e9c982ff5d50a8de13f341e","ja":"あ……私たちの劇の役、それぞれをイメージした、\n5つの香水……そ、それなら……！","zh":"啊……以我们剧中各个角色为灵感设计的\n5款香水……那、那样的话……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2c4c7bac1bcf16b5782579d883272ce6f0fd276a7e74797242796fe812f23407","ja":"えっと……が、頑張ります……！\nみんなの香り……み、見つけてきますね……！","zh":"那个……我、我会努力的……！\n大家的气味……我、我会找出来的……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8edc7c99df644a738bc38102dc0d83f60ccf130c6d216bf850f4d17ff259fb51","ja":"うーん……ちょいワルな、香りって……\nどうすれば……？","zh":"唔……稍微有点坏的气息……\n要怎么做才好呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"15e0ae36166083bf711c9f26c411059cc30b4fc0e376a9f9a5def1555d578930","ja":"あれ？　なんかいろんな香りがする……あ！\n可憐が持ってるのって、コラボ香水？","zh":"咦？总觉得有各种香味……啊！\n可怜拿着的那个，是联名香水吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b85c4207feb7dab65dff74a9daf3b059a66826db42954e25d4ae6e59510721be","ja":"可憐さんがプロデュースするんですよね！\nすごいです！","zh":"是由可怜小姐担任制作对吧！\n好厉害啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"31d6f4ecffc9597496077b423845cedfb88305e65dd31e98d5f3f7a279362aa2","ja":"えっ……！　う、ううん……。\nそんな、すごいなんてほどじゃあ……。","zh":"诶……！没、没有啦……。\n哪有那么厉害……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e4b51fe785d87de61507de7e052b17d83f355279fc2c505ee944d1e2b3a00ead","ja":"まだ、みんなの香水……どんなものにするか……\nは、はっきりと、決まってないし……。","zh":"大家的香水……究竟要做成什么样的……\n也、也还没明确定下来呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7f316fc863d315b36d542a5caf903428d7ab7c488661acbdd7c20d43fba62400","ja":"だから……ふたりの意見も、\n聞かせてくれると……うれしいです。","zh":"所以……要是也能听听\n你们两个人的意见……我会很高兴的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3b88e0093de85794b8b86378ec8c77dc10eba01c610d93f81dd973725c22b268","ja":"そう？　あんまり自信ないけど……\n可憐がそう言うなら、頑張ってみようかな♪","zh":"是吗？虽然我没什么自信……\n不过既然可怜都这么说了，那我就努力试试看吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"6b26f6c4ad462e5a7f2bd1dfeb3fbd703d898f76a10829dfc60e149efb0255fb","ja":"はい、微力ながらお手伝いさせてください。\nコラボ香水、素敵なものにしましょう！","zh":"好的，虽然微不足道，但也请让我出一份力。\n联名香水，一定要做得很棒哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1059.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"873c0273b4342fc2557ce49edbe41ecc9f821028a1dfce115d08093b37aeaa0d","ja":"歩さん、静香ちゃん……ありがとう……♪","zh":"步小姐、静香……谢谢你们……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
